09ed94cbf259a4a93b0f1dfe0a.600x338.jpg?t=1764543264"}],"short_description":"Black hole fishing is an absurd incremental game about catching fish. Stock your pond with genetically modified fish, conduct outlandish experiments to discover exotic new fish traits, and feed enough fish to a singularity to destroy the planet - for science!","steam_appid":3667390,"support_info":{"email":"support@sdggamecollective.org","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}